== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{I|Mom's Box|r+}}: Each copy adds one more charge to Isaac's active item.

== Trivia ==
* This trinket used to be called [[anti:Electric Penny|Electric Penny]] in ''Antibirth'', and had a different sprite. In ''Antibirth'', it was always unlocked and nickels and dimes would proc the charge chance 5 and 10 times respectively.

